dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.audio.diff
version 1
schema stdio.semio.audio
start body
framing record

# ARTIFACT-SYSTEM-OVERHAUL-REAL-CODECS-RUNTIME-REUSE-EVOLUTION audio wave: REAL binary diff frame,
# replacing the old `print_diff().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut (`🔺️diff/🦀️component.rs`'s
# old `DiffCodec::encode_diff`). `format u8` + `presence u8` (bit0=`sample_rate` bit1=`format`
# bit2=`channels` bit3=`tags`) are two REAL fixed fields; past that, 0-4 varint-length-prefixed
# opaque blobs follow (one per present field) — modeled as one opaque trailing `payload` chain
# rather than per-segment `Cond`-guarded fields because a SECOND `if`-guard on a field that was
# itself only conditionally decoded hard-errors `eval_cond` (`protocol-cond-cannot-chain`, same gap
# `✳️flow`'s/`✳️image`'s own diff protocols document). The real Rust `encode_diff`/`decode_diff`
# stays genuinely, fully structured (`write_str_lp`/`read_str_lp`, `store::pack_rt`'s real varint
# codec) — round-trip tested independently.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field presence u8

chain payload bytes
